# @260903-4-0959
# .jsonh is JSON with Hash comments, a convention by BitMiller for BitMiller, founded at this exact moment.
# But it turned out with a Google search on "jsonh format" that there's already a compatible convention:
# > https://github.com/jsonh-org/Jsonh - JSON for Humans.
# Since JSONC not supports e.g. hash comments, and Jsonh does. As well as John Doe.

